# quarantine/ is deliberately NOT ignored (ADR-070).
# The prior entry treated it as local scratch. The reattack quarantine is
# the opposite: tracked, versioned, provenance-preserving. Content is made
# UNCITEABLE by a gate, never invisible by an ignore rule -- a corpus you
# cannot see is a corpus you cannot audit, and it silently stops existing
# for every consumer but the one machine holding the working copy.
